cff-version: 1.2.0
title: nf-nomad manuscript assets
message: If you use these assets, please cite both this record and the nf-nomad manuscript.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/abhi18av-phd-projects/nf-nomad-manuscript-assets"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible infrastructure templates and a reviewer protocol for nf-nomad, the Nextflow
  executor plugin for HashiCorp Nomad. Provides a containerised multi-node deployment that runs
  on a single machine, a preemptible Google Cloud deployment, per-mode Nextflow configurations,
  a preemption-resilience harness, and the measured datasets behind the manuscript's results.
keywords:
  - Nextflow
  - HashiCorp Nomad
  - bioinformatics
  - workflow management
  - reproducibility
  - infrastructure as code
authors:
  - given-names: Abhinav
    family-names: Sharma
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6402-6993"
  - given-names: Jorge
    family-names: Aguilera
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-5537-7029"
